# #152 drills and multi-hit aerials: Archer's shared up air (2 hits). Archer a against Archer b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero archer
# Both dash in, close.
40 b stick -1 0
42 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
52 a stick 0 0
# Up air under b, which jumped first toward a.
94 b tap B 8
95 b stick -0.6 0
100 a tap B 8
101 a stick 0.6 0
115 a cstick 0 1
115 a stick 0 0
115 b stick 0 0
119 a cstick 0 0
# Frames saved on hits (native only; illustration for the look box).
120 a capture
125 a capture
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the aerial starts, then every hit.
#! expect a 115 applied attack 1 style 15
#! expect b 120 damage 4.000
#! expect b 125 damage 12.000
#! scene a StampedeMissileDeath
# View held a second, twice: the moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
